    "innovation": "This study systematically evaluates five different representations of cloud-borne aerosol in a global model, concluding that while simpler diagnostic schemes introduce local errors up to 40%, the choice of representation is not a significant source of uncertainty for estimates of aerosol direct and indirect effects.",
